  "acceptedContent": [
    "ordinary constructive closure is not CeDG durable identity closure",
    "the parent algorithm of every copied labeled geo is added when each of its other inputs is already copied; global constants and axes are referenced by name; only parents of copied geos are added, never dependents of the copied set",
    "no durable CeDG identity for ordinary geometry, no spatial records, no copied axes, no change of identity schema, serialization format or migration, no change of the C1 identity-bearing clipboard semantics"
  ],
